&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Footnotes&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-10222-1&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;. The specifics of this mistake have been omitted in keeping with Protocol 5925-Eshu.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-10222-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. The specifics of SCP-5925&#039;s escape has been omitted in keeping with protocol 5925-Eshu.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-10222-3&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;3&lt;/a&gt;. Described as akin to those of a stag.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-10222-4&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;4&lt;/a&gt;. Later analysis of these stains suggest they are of tree sap, which may stem from repeated impacts against oak wood.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-10222-5&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;5&lt;/a&gt;. Commonly known as holly.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
