an&quot;  &gt;Doctor Cimmerian&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scp-wiki.net/forum/t-12849238/calm#post-4442372|&quot;&gt;other authors&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br /&gt;
