&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span&gt;Foreign Esoteric Classes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The following are object classes created by non-English affiliate branches of the Foundation which are considered &amp;quot;Established&amp;quot;.&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-22992-4&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;4&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thank you to &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ziakial&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2291501&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1608366279&quot; alt=&quot;Ziakial&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2291501)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ziakial&quot;  &gt;Ziakial&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; for originally compiling this list.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;eso-list&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block&quot;&gt;
